Q: How to scroll without moving my cursor in Visual Studio Code from the Keyboard A: <p>In VS Code keyboard shortcuts, set the <code>scrollLineUp</code> and <code>scrollLineUp</code> settings  to customize this actions. You can customize via the UI or shortcut JSON. Example:</p>
<pre><code>{
  &quot;key&quot;: &quot;cmd+down&quot;,
  &quot;command&quot;: &quot;scrollLineDown&quot;,
  &quot;when&quot;: &quot;textInputFocus&quot;
}
</code></pre>
